WEBVTT

00:00:02.510 --> 00:00:05.500
Everyone, when you're watching Deltora Quest,

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:09.250
Make sure you're in a well- lit room and sit far away from the TV!

00:00:17.260 --> 00:00:23.970
When I open this door
Kono doa akereba atarashii sekai ga

00:00:24.720 --> 00:00:27.860
A brand new world is starting right now
Ima hajimarunda

00:00:29.960 --> 00:00:34.440
Even if there are painful things on my way
Tsurai koto ga aru toshitemo

00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:40.840
I will show you that I can overcome them all
Kitto norikoetemiseru

00:00:42.190 --> 00:00:48.600
I'm starting to walk on a brand new world now
Atarashii sekai ni ima arukidashita soko ha

00:00:48.600 --> 00:00:54.830
And I'm sure there are [Dreams] and [Hope] there
[Yume] ya [Kibou] ga aru kara

00:00:54.830 --> 00:00:58.050
This feeling is making my heart beat so fast
Dokidoki suru kono kimochi

00:00:58.050 --> 00:01:01.180
And there's no one who can stop it
darenimo tomerarenai

00:01:01.180 --> 00:01:06.200
My heart is tightening and jumping all over the place
Kyun to hazumu kokoro

00:01:07.370 --> 00:01:10.560
So start flapping your wings from now
Koko kara habataiteiku

00:01:10.560 --> 00:01:13.610
and soar high to the sky up there
ano sora he to takaku

00:01:13.610 --> 00:01:19.580
Aiming for [Tomorrow] and [The Future] beyond
[Ashita] [Mirai] mezashite

00:01:19.580 --> 00:01:22.910
We will definitely grow bigger someday
Itsuka ookiku nareru to

00:01:22.910 --> 00:01:26.180
That's what I believed
sou shinjiteiru no

00:01:26.180 --> 00:01:31.340
That's why, just spread your wings
Dakara tsubasa wo hiroge

00:01:39.800 --> 00:01:54.750
The Japanese Deltora Quest is brought to you in English by ToranSubs

00:01:56.070 --> 00:01:57.500
<i>My name is Lief.</i>

00:01:57.500 --> 00:02:04.070
<i>In order to bring peace back to Deltora, I defeated evil monsters and recovered the topaz, ruby and opal!</i>

00:02:04.070 --> 00:02:07.090
<i>Honestly... You're always just being reckless though.</i>

00:02:07.090 --> 00:02:07.840
<i>Jasmine!</i>

00:02:07.840 --> 00:02:10.040
<i>It's all thanks to me that you even got this far.</i>

00:02:10.040 --> 00:02:11.600
<i>And don't forget about me either.</i>

00:02:11.600 --> 00:02:12.500
<i>Barda!</i>

00:02:14.380 --> 00:02:15.600
<i>Filli! Kree!</i>

00:02:16.450 --> 00:02:20.200
<i>We are in the middle of our journey to search for the seven gems!</i>

00:02:20.200 --> 00:02:24.700
<i>And right now, we're on our way to the
Shifting Sands where the fourth gem is hidden!</i>

00:02:55.930 --> 00:02:57.350
It's so hot...

00:02:59.780 --> 00:03:00.700
Yeah...

00:03:01.400 --> 00:03:05.000
It's completely different to how it was on the other side of the wall.

00:03:13.840 --> 00:03:16.680
There it is... I can hear that strange sound again...

00:03:19.000 --> 00:03:19.860
Again?

00:03:20.240 --> 00:03:22.160
What kind of sound is it?

00:03:22.490 --> 00:03:28.040
It's like a deep buzzing noise... I feel like I've heard it somewhere before...

00:03:32.220 --> 00:03:34.650
The sound... stopped.

00:03:35.130 --> 00:03:39.350
And you still can't recall where you heard it last?

00:03:39.350 --> 00:03:44.940
Yeah... But, I feel like I've definitely been here before.

00:03:46.570 --> 00:03:51.280
Or to be exact, I've seen it in one of the visions of the future that the opal showed me.

00:03:51.920 --> 00:03:54.580
I'm sure of it; it was definitely in this desert.

00:03:56.780 --> 00:03:58.390
What kind of future was it?

00:03:58.730 --> 00:04:03.920
I'm not entirely sure, but I was standing all alone in this desert, and...

00:04:03.920 --> 00:04:08.960
I was desperately calling out your names, but you were nowhere to be found...

00:04:08.960 --> 00:04:11.690
So it wasn't a pleasant future at all, then...

00:04:12.000 --> 00:04:12.600
No...

00:04:13.760 --> 00:04:17.820
I definitely don't want that kind of future...!

00:04:17.820 --> 00:04:19.690
Don't worry about it, Lief.

00:04:21.720 --> 00:04:28.200
The fourth gem that will shine brightly upon our future is definitely hidden in this place.

00:04:28.810 --> 00:04:29.600
Am I right?

00:04:30.460 --> 00:04:31.400
Yeah, you're right.

00:04:31.860 --> 00:04:35.590
But where do we start searching for it in this huge place?

00:04:36.050 --> 00:04:42.390
That won't be a problem. The belt will surely become warmer when we get closer to the gem.

00:04:42.390 --> 00:04:44.890
Just as it always has done.

00:04:44.890 --> 00:04:49.230
Then, are you telling me to wander around this desert until the belt becomes hot?

00:04:49.690 --> 00:04:52.380
Just how many years do you think that would take?

00:04:52.380 --> 00:04:55.200
No, I don't think it will take that long.

00:04:55.980 --> 00:05:00.400
This gem is most likely also being protected by some sort of guardian...

00:05:00.400 --> 00:05:04.500
And that guardian has already sensed our presence here.

00:05:04.500 --> 00:05:06.200
How can you be so sure?

00:05:06.800 --> 00:05:08.000
I just can feel it...

00:05:08.800 --> 00:05:11.300
It's also what the belt is telling me.

00:05:15.020 --> 00:05:20.220
Let's go. The gem's guardian should be somewhere not too far from here.

00:05:20.930 --> 00:05:24.930
Even if we don't look for them, I'm sure that they will still come for us.

00:05:25.420 --> 00:05:28.510
Then in that case, we must hurry.

00:05:28.850 --> 00:05:33.000
We don't want to upset them by keeping them waiting now, do we?

00:05:33.000 --> 00:05:33.600
Yeah.

00:05:35.410 --> 00:05:39.820
Then by all means, lead the way. I'll be sure to follow close behind.

00:06:09.950 --> 00:06:12.200
We've covered a lot of ground...

00:06:13.060 --> 00:06:17.690
At least we don't have to worry about getting lost with all of these footprints.

00:06:17.690 --> 00:06:22.910
But on the other hand, they can also lead the Grey Guards straight to us.

00:06:24.570 --> 00:06:27.400
Do you think that they are still pursuing us after all?

00:06:27.400 --> 00:06:33.220
For certain; their own lives are on the line. I doubt they will give up that easily.

00:06:34.200 --> 00:06:35.800
Just let them come!

00:06:36.500 --> 00:06:38.800
This time I'll give them a good fight!

00:06:39.700 --> 00:06:41.000
What's that over there?

00:06:52.210 --> 00:06:54.200
Whatever it is, it's scaring these two.

00:07:01.010 --> 00:07:01.980
Get moving!

00:07:04.290 --> 00:07:06.050
They shouldn't be too far!

00:07:06.050 --> 00:07:08.610
Indeed! These footprints are still fresh, after all!

00:07:09.060 --> 00:07:10.500
Don't let them get away!

00:07:10.650 --> 00:07:11.220
Right!

00:07:12.900 --> 00:07:14.790
So they're finally here...

00:07:14.790 --> 00:07:17.120
Looks like they've brought more comrades.

00:07:17.120 --> 00:07:20.010
Yeah. I can see at least four of them.

00:07:20.520 --> 00:07:21.700
What should we do?

00:07:21.700 --> 00:07:24.340
To fight, or to run...

00:07:24.680 --> 00:07:26.000
I just had a good idea.

00:07:27.160 --> 00:07:29.290
Follow me you two.

00:07:34.750 --> 00:07:36.220
I see...!

00:07:36.220 --> 00:07:38.120
This is a great option!

00:07:40.580 --> 00:07:42.000
Let's just hide around here.

00:07:42.630 --> 00:07:43.280
There!

00:07:50.030 --> 00:07:52.980
Damn it! There's still no sight of those bastards?!

00:07:53.630 --> 00:07:56.890
Just follow their footprints for now! We can't let them get away!!

00:07:56.990 --> 00:07:57.600
Right!

00:08:00.590 --> 00:08:01.500
Hey, look!

00:08:03.200 --> 00:08:06.460
What's the meaning of this?! Their footprints have disappeared!

00:08:06.460 --> 00:08:07.530
Did they fly away?

00:08:07.530 --> 00:08:07.590
- Of course not, fool!!
Did they fly away?

00:08:07.590 --> 00:08:08.510
- Of course not, fool!!

00:08:08.510 --> 00:08:08.700
Then how do you explain this?!
- Of course not, fool!!

00:08:08.700 --> 00:08:10.000
Then how do you explain this?!

00:08:10.030 --> 00:08:14.390
Could it be that they have already been eaten by that monster?

00:08:14.730 --> 00:08:18.250
That's why I told you we should have knocked them out cold again back then!

00:08:18.250 --> 00:08:20.840
And what good will bringing that up now do, Carn 8?!

00:08:20.840 --> 00:08:24.000
More importantly, aren't we in danger here...?

00:08:27.120 --> 00:08:28.400
He's right...

00:08:30.600 --> 00:08:32.240
Don't get all afraid!

00:08:32.240 --> 00:08:36.090
Those three are crafty; they must be hiding in the sand somewhere!

00:08:36.090 --> 00:08:38.310
Search for them! Now!!

00:08:42.070 --> 00:08:44.700
Shit!! Where are they hiding?!

00:08:44.880 --> 00:08:46.840
Hey, go and search that way too!

00:08:48.770 --> 00:08:51.710
This is bad... They're coming this way...!

00:08:51.710 --> 00:08:54.990
Just stay still. That's all we can do for now.

00:08:54.990 --> 00:08:55.520
Yeah.

00:09:14.760 --> 00:09:16.300
Stop it, Filli!

00:09:16.300 --> 00:09:17.600
Stop jumping around!

00:09:27.680 --> 00:09:28.800
Come at us then!!

00:09:51.630 --> 00:09:52.480
What...?

00:10:04.530 --> 00:10:09.100
<i>This giant creature is the infamous sand beast, Terreocti.</i>

00:10:09.760 --> 00:10:18.500
<i>Normally, this ferocious monster remains underground while feeling the vibrations that other creatures make before attacking them with its sharp claws.</i>

00:10:20.600 --> 00:10:23.700
Wh...What in the world... is this...?

00:11:04.640 --> 00:11:06.010
It's eating them alive...

00:11:06.010 --> 00:11:07.210
No way...

00:11:35.040 --> 00:11:37.360
Guys, we should run while we can...!

00:11:37.360 --> 00:11:39.000
No, don't move.

00:11:39.870 --> 00:11:45.790
Even though we were closer, that monster ignored us and attacked the Grey Guards who ran away instead.

00:11:45.790 --> 00:11:48.390
So it probably attacks based on movement.

00:11:48.930 --> 00:11:54.190
Yeah... It can probably feel the vibrations from the sand or something...

00:11:54.190 --> 00:11:55.810
Then what are we going to do?

00:11:56.120 --> 00:11:58.700
Let's just wait and see for now.

00:12:12.480 --> 00:12:14.160
What are those...?

00:12:14.160 --> 00:12:16.330
They're probably... its stomachs...

00:12:16.540 --> 00:12:17.420
Stomachs...?

00:12:17.920 --> 00:12:20.890
It's expanding after eating the Grey Guards.

00:12:32.690 --> 00:12:34.200
Now what is it doing?!

00:12:34.720 --> 00:12:36.400
It's trying to lay its eggs!

00:12:37.100 --> 00:12:38.270
Eggs?

00:12:38.270 --> 00:12:42.400
That's how it makes sure its young will have enough food after they've hatched.

00:12:42.810 --> 00:12:48.900
I see...! So what we saw on our way here was the aftermath of them hatching, then...!

00:13:17.280 --> 00:13:19.000
Has it gone...?

00:13:19.500 --> 00:13:20.000
Yeah...

00:13:24.730 --> 00:13:27.490
Seems like we're safe somehow, then...

00:13:29.230 --> 00:13:30.460
What's this?

00:13:31.900 --> 00:13:35.000
I don't remember seeing those circles here before...

00:13:36.770 --> 00:13:39.080
Maybe the footprints of another animal?

00:13:39.080 --> 00:13:43.440
That can't be. We should have noticed if another creature appeared.

00:13:43.440 --> 00:13:50.820
However, it wouldn't be at all unusual for there to be other mysterious creatures in the Shifting Sands.

00:13:52.060 --> 00:13:52.950
Isn't this...?

00:13:53.870 --> 00:13:56.610
It's a bag that we were carrying gold coins in!

00:13:56.610 --> 00:14:00.240
So the Grey Guards had our prize money with them them, huh...

00:14:01.460 --> 00:14:03.020
But where are the gold coins?

00:14:03.020 --> 00:14:09.050
Who knows? Maybe the Grey Guards spent them, or maybe they're now inside that monster's stomach.

00:14:09.050 --> 00:14:11.650
Don't those patterns look exactly like gold coins?

00:14:13.090 --> 00:14:14.230
What's going on here?

00:14:14.750 --> 00:14:17.760
Are you saying that this desert imitated the gold coins?

00:14:18.100 --> 00:14:21.310
I'm not sure, but I can sense it...

00:14:22.220 --> 00:14:25.920
There may be more to the sands of this desert than meets the eye....

00:14:25.920 --> 00:14:28.780
Are you saying that the desert itself is a monster?

00:14:28.780 --> 00:14:30.670
I don't know, but...

00:14:35.130 --> 00:14:35.890
Lief?

00:14:36.600 --> 00:14:39.390
There it is again... That strange sound...!

00:14:42.990 --> 00:14:45.400
And it sounds a lot closer than before...!

00:14:45.710 --> 00:14:48.000
I still can't hear anything though...

00:14:48.240 --> 00:14:49.190
Me neither...

00:14:55.850 --> 00:14:56.520
Lief...?!

00:15:00.150 --> 00:15:01.400
Please stop...

00:15:02.220 --> 00:15:04.310
Make it stop!!

00:15:06.850 --> 00:15:08.450
Stop that, Lief!

00:15:08.920 --> 00:15:10.790
You'll make that monster come back!

00:15:25.580 --> 00:15:26.820
Lief!!

00:15:31.320 --> 00:15:34.040
<i>Hand over the belt...</i>

00:15:35.470 --> 00:15:38.400
<i>Hand over the belt...</i>

00:15:38.400 --> 00:15:39.310
The belt?

00:15:39.730 --> 00:15:42.300
<i>Offer up the belt...</i>

00:15:42.560 --> 00:15:47.410
<i>Offer up the belt to The Hive...!</i>

00:15:47.720 --> 00:15:49.040
<i>Offer it...</i>

00:15:49.800 --> 00:15:51.550
<i>Offer it...</i>

00:15:51.630 --> 00:15:52.500
No!

00:15:53.500 --> 00:15:55.530
I will never hand you the belt!

00:15:55.530 --> 00:15:57.000
No matter what!

00:16:10.220 --> 00:16:10.920
Lief!!

00:16:12.190 --> 00:16:13.950
Are you alright, Lief?!

00:16:15.450 --> 00:16:16.910
What happened to you?

00:16:17.190 --> 00:16:19.450
I don't know either...

00:16:19.450 --> 00:16:22.650
I just heard that buzzing sound again, and...

00:16:23.180 --> 00:16:25.790
All of a sudden, my head felt like it was going to split open.

00:16:26.630 --> 00:16:29.300
That sandstorm just now wasn't normal.

00:16:29.880 --> 00:16:34.440
And even though Lief thrashed around that much, the monster from earlier didn't show up either...

00:16:35.900 --> 00:16:40.600
Perhaps that sandstorm was the true face of the Shifting Sands...

00:16:41.190 --> 00:16:42.800
The Shifting Sand's...

00:16:43.130 --> 00:16:44.800
Huh? What?

00:16:45.400 --> 00:16:47.400
My dagger is gone!

00:16:48.440 --> 00:16:52.110
Where is it? Where... That dagger is really important to me!

00:16:52.300 --> 00:16:53.100
Over there...

00:16:56.280 --> 00:16:57.280
What...?

00:16:57.600 --> 00:16:59.310
Isn't this Jasmine's dagger?

00:16:59.800 --> 00:17:06.890
Yeah... Most likely, someone or something behind that sandstorm took Jasmine's dagger as tribute, I think...

00:17:07.530 --> 00:17:08.620
As tribute...?

00:17:09.160 --> 00:17:13.550
It's probably satisfied with your knife; that's why it stopped the sandstorm.

00:17:13.550 --> 00:17:18.320
Therefore, I'm certain now that the patterns on the sand before were really our gold coins.

00:17:18.320 --> 00:17:19.600
What do you mean?

00:17:20.410 --> 00:17:25.700
The guardian of this demonic land probably wants gemstones or valuable money, I think.

00:17:26.110 --> 00:17:31.660
Unbelievable... So you're saying that there's a monster that likes gemstones and money?

00:17:31.660 --> 00:17:35.600
Indeed... But if that's what Lief feels, then...

00:17:36.040 --> 00:17:38.800
Furthermore, there's the stone monument.

00:17:40.050 --> 00:17:47.410
"Death swarms within its rocky wall. Where all are one, one will rules all."

00:17:48.010 --> 00:17:53.100
"Below the dead, the living strive. With mindless will to serve the Hive."

00:17:54.840 --> 00:17:59.410
I think that this "Hive" is something that rules over the Shifting Sands.

00:17:59.410 --> 00:18:07.690
And this Hive is probably taking all of the valuables that can be found in the sand to its domain.

00:18:08.760 --> 00:18:09.880
I see...

00:18:11.340 --> 00:18:12.740
The belt is safe, right?!

00:18:13.480 --> 00:18:15.600
It's alright. It's still here.

00:18:18.710 --> 00:18:19.890
What's wrong, Lief?

00:18:20.690 --> 00:18:25.290
I'm just afraid that I will see that frightening future again if I touch the opal...

00:18:31.710 --> 00:18:34.390
But... I have to go on!

00:18:35.210 --> 00:18:41.500
The belt has remained cold this entire time.
It seems that our destination is still far from here.

00:18:44.890 --> 00:18:46.910
Then, shall we go?

00:18:47.270 --> 00:18:52.000
The sooner we get there, the sooner we can leave this creepy desert behind.

00:18:52.000 --> 00:18:57.000
I agree. There's no need to stay in this dangerous place for longer than we have to.

00:18:59.300 --> 00:19:00.020
Wait.

00:19:02.060 --> 00:19:03.700
I have a request.

00:19:04.560 --> 00:19:06.400
What? Go ahead.

00:19:07.330 --> 00:19:13.600
I think it's better to tie our bodies with a rope from this point on, so that we won't get separated from one another.

00:19:15.060 --> 00:19:22.200
When we were tied up and stuffed in those bags, I really thought that I was lucky to have the two of you with me.

00:19:22.910 --> 00:19:24.200
Funny, isn't it?

00:19:24.700 --> 00:19:29.700
Even though I knew full well that we might have been saved faster if one of us were able to escape...

00:19:29.990 --> 00:19:33.310
I just can't help but feel glad to be together.

00:19:33.320 --> 00:19:36.700
Isn't it obvious that it's better for the three of us to be together?

00:19:37.550 --> 00:19:40.620
Three heads are always better than one, right?

00:19:40.620 --> 00:19:41.800
That's right.

00:19:42.300 --> 00:19:45.000
Let's go with your idea, Lief.

00:20:14.550 --> 00:20:16.200
It's really gotten cold...

00:20:16.710 --> 00:20:23.720
I've read of it before, but to think that the difference in temperature between day and night in the desert would be this extreme...

00:20:24.040 --> 00:20:26.380
Hey, can we rest here for the night?

00:20:26.380 --> 00:20:30.080
But the belt is still not getting warmer at all...

00:20:31.260 --> 00:20:34.520
That's why we should get some rest while we can.

00:20:34.840 --> 00:20:38.000
After all, we won't be able to rest when it becomes hotter, right?

00:20:39.070 --> 00:20:40.000
I guess so...

00:20:40.870 --> 00:20:44.720
Let's take turns keeping watch while the other two sleep.

00:20:45.080 --> 00:20:47.180
Yeah, that would be best.

00:20:47.180 --> 00:20:51.310
You two can get some sleep first. I'll keep watch.

00:20:51.790 --> 00:20:53.600
Thanks, Barda...

00:20:53.600 --> 00:20:55.410
Wake me up when it's my turn.

00:21:01.500 --> 00:21:03.990
Looks like he sure was tired...

00:21:04.830 --> 00:21:11.290
He's been seeing and hearing things that we can't, after all; it must be exhausting...

00:21:12.140 --> 00:21:15.000
But with this rope on, I doubt he can sleep comfortably.

00:21:16.800 --> 00:21:20.200
I guess so. We can at least take them off while sleeping.

00:21:26.430 --> 00:21:29.990
You guys should get a good night's sleep, too.

00:21:30.440 --> 00:21:33.210
Thanks. I'll do that.

00:21:44.200 --> 00:21:45.210
Another sandstorm?!

00:21:56.680 --> 00:21:57.400
Lief!

00:22:00.450 --> 00:22:01.200
Barda!

00:22:04.770 --> 00:22:06.890
<i>Hand it over...</i>

00:22:07.240 --> 00:22:09.430
<i>Hand over the belt...</i>

00:22:10.090 --> 00:22:13.220
<i>Offer the belt to The Hive now...!</i>

00:22:13.360 --> 00:22:14.300
No way!

00:22:14.300 --> 00:22:14.780
<i>Hand over the belt...</i>

00:22:14.780 --> 00:22:15.960
Stop it...!

00:22:15.960 --> 00:22:16.300
<i>Hand over the belt...</i>

00:22:16.750 --> 00:22:17.160
Stop!!

00:22:17.160 --> 00:22:17.790
<i>The belt...
Stop!!</i>

00:22:17.790 --> 00:22:18.310
<i>The belt...</i>

00:22:19.240 --> 00:22:20.270
<i>The belt...!</i>

00:22:20.270 --> 00:22:22.290
Stop it!!

00:22:24.690 --> 00:22:27.060
Lief! Lief!!

00:22:35.160 --> 00:22:40.390
Every moment is a gate to fantasia
Every moment is a gate to fantasia

00:22:41.040 --> 00:22:47.690
You just do it to be an shining star
You just do it to be an shining star

00:22:47.690 --> 00:22:51.050
Ooh la la! The gentle wind that's brushing my cheek in the evening
Ooh la la! Yawarakana kaze hoo naderu yuugata

00:22:51.050 --> 00:22:53.560
If you start to walk with your head held high
Moshi kimi ga uemuki arukidasu nara

00:22:53.560 --> 00:22:57.980
The big red sun will surely give its blessing to you
Ooki na akai taiyou ga kimi wo shukufuku shitekureru darou

00:22:57.980 --> 00:23:00.480
If you stay stricken because you stumbled
Nanika ni tsumazuki uchihishigarete

00:23:00.480 --> 00:23:02.780
And keep hanging your head in shame
Moshi kimi ga utsumuitamama nara

00:23:03.070 --> 00:23:05.070
Then you are probably going to miss
Sono kandouteki na ONE SCENE

00:23:05.280 --> 00:23:07.840
That very touching one scene
Nogashite shimau kamoshirenai kara

00:23:07.840 --> 00:23:10.660
HEY NOW ! Everything that lives on this earth
HEY NOW ! Kono chikyuu de ikiru mono subete

00:23:10.660 --> 00:23:13.210
Sea, Sky, Sun that blessed us in these 7 Days
Umi, sora to taiyou megumi no 7 DAYS

00:23:13.210 --> 00:23:16.010
Since when did I get this thirsty?
Itsu kara ka nodo kawakikittamama

00:23:16.010 --> 00:23:18.560
I turned my back to this town and kept walking away
Kono machi wo se ni ue ni ue ni "WALK AWAY"

00:23:18.560 --> 00:23:20.850
No matter how far or deep you look for it
Tooku made oku no oku made

00:23:20.850 --> 00:23:23.730
In the end, it's just a problem that you don't know the answer to
Mitetara kekkyoku wakaranai mondaiten

00:23:23.730 --> 00:23:25.790
Before saying that you can't go on anymore
Mou dame tte iu mae ni ippo

00:23:25.790 --> 00:23:28.110
That little bit of courage will surely bring forth the second chapter.
Sukoshi no yuuki de dai ni shou e kitto

00:23:28.110 --> 00:23:30.640
HEY NOW ! Let's draw on a brand new page
HEY NOW ! Arata na PAGE egakou

00:23:30.640 --> 00:23:33.130
HEY NOW ! Take my hand and we gonna go
HEY NOW ! Te wo totte saa WE GONNA GO

00:23:33.130 --> 00:23:36.980
HEY NOW ! Whether you go up or down, it's the same second
HEY NOW ! Agattemo sagattemo onaji ichibyou

00:23:36.980 --> 00:23:38.140
GET UP ! STAND UP !
GET UP ! STAND UP !

00:23:38.140 --> 00:23:40.710
HEY NOW ! Let's draw on a brand new page
HEY NOW ! Arata na PAGE egakou

00:23:40.710 --> 00:23:43.250
HEY NOW ! Take my hand and we gonna go
HEY NOW ! Te wo totte saa WE GONNA GO

00:23:43.250 --> 00:23:47.090
HEY NOW ! Whetter you cry or laugh, it's just once for life
HEY NOW ! Naitemo warattemo tatta ikkai

00:23:47.090 --> 00:23:48.260
GET UP ! STAND UP !
GET UP ! STAND UP !

00:23:48.260 --> 00:23:58.330
HEY NOW ! La la la...
HEY NOW ! La la la la la la la la la la la la...

