<i>The Sand Beast.</i>

00:24:08.980 --> 00:24:14.630
<i>Its actual name is Terreocti, a creature that normally stays hidden under the sand.</i>

00:24:14.630 --> 00:24:19.280
<i>It has several stomachs which are usually used to feed its children after they hatch.</i>

00:24:21.020 --> 00:24:23.980
I became separated from my companions in the sandstorm.

00:24:24.600 --> 00:24:27.500
But then, The Hive was trying to talk with me.

00:24:28.010 --> 00:24:30.460
Are we really fated to fight it after all?

